2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Map authority, steps and evidence.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Locate discretion and notice.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Count time, cost and exposure.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Preserve challenge and recourse routes.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Judge policy through lived navigation.
